WEBVTT

00:03.690 --> 00:07.810
We have collected four of the Seven Jewels of Virtue,

00:07.810 --> 00:11.280
and the bonds between Elis and the others grow even stronger.

00:12.260 --> 00:18.520
I believe that with how they are right now, they can overcome this trial.

00:19.120 --> 00:22.620
But, if that is not the case, then I am counting on you.

00:26.270 --> 00:29.260
Dream...

02:12.790 --> 02:15.940
Today's tea is Jasmine tea.

02:16.350 --> 02:20.360
The fragrance from the jasmine has a relaxing effect you know.

02:21.930 --> 02:23.890
It smells great.

02:23.890 --> 02:26.230
I think I've smelled this fragrance before...

02:26.230 --> 02:28.620
Ah, it's from the toilet's air freshener.

02:30.700 --> 02:33.630
Hiiragi-san, you really have no consideration at all do you.

02:33.630 --> 02:34.950
Shut up!

02:34.950 --> 02:37.130
How about learning a thing or two from him?

02:42.850 --> 02:45.100
Umm, who might you be?

02:47.520 --> 02:49.300
My name is Nightmare.

02:49.770 --> 02:50.850
A dream weaver.

02:51.370 --> 02:55.320
He is one of the Wizards who've continued to assist me over the years.

02:55.320 --> 02:58.940
He happened to be here today so I asked him to join us for tea.

02:59.510 --> 03:01.450
You're elusive as usual.

03:03.010 --> 03:05.520
More importantly, hurry up and tell us about the mission.

03:05.520 --> 03:07.750
You don't need to be so grumpy about it.

03:07.750 --> 03:10.620
It must be because you didn't do well on your makeup exam, right?

03:11.000 --> 03:12.690
I still don't know how I did!

03:12.690 --> 03:16.280
I did my best, and 'the die is cast' or whatever they call it!

03:16.280 --> 03:19.210
You sure its not 'throwing your spoon'?

03:21.070 --> 03:22.010
What's wrong?

03:22.010 --> 03:25.760
I'm sorry, but my head hurts a bit.

03:25.760 --> 03:28.470
Ah, it's true, you don't look so good.

03:29.140 --> 03:33.270
Ah, it must be because of the Jewel of Temperance I have here.

03:35.850 --> 03:37.970
What's the meaning of this?!

03:37.970 --> 03:39.530
We haven't done anything yet!

03:40.510 --> 03:44.990
Your group is not the only one on the quest to find the jewels.

03:44.990 --> 03:50.510
This jewel was acquired by a certain other party, and was sent here.

03:53.680 --> 03:57.000
Here you go, Elis-san. Please take it.

03:57.680 --> 03:59.800
Now then, no need to hold back, here.

03:59.800 --> 04:01.420
Y-Yes.

04:06.830 --> 04:07.870
Elis-chan?!

04:07.870 --> 04:09.090
Hey, Elis!

04:09.090 --> 04:10.310
Elis!

04:19.270 --> 04:20.880
She's sleeping...

04:20.880 --> 04:23.360
Anzelotte, what did you do to Elis?!

04:23.680 --> 04:25.990
How could this happen?!

04:25.990 --> 04:31.700
Elis-san was sealed inside her very own heart by the power of the Jewel of Temperance!

04:33.000 --> 04:36.540
The Jewel of Temperance is a jewel that can take control over various things.

04:37.270 --> 04:42.510
It has the ability to take hold of the consciousness of those who touch it, and imprison it within them.

04:42.910 --> 04:46.350
The only way to save Elis-san and recover the jewel,

04:46.350 --> 04:52.260
is to dive into her closed heart and recover Elis-san's own consciousness from the inside.

04:52.260 --> 04:53.250
What?!

04:53.250 --> 04:57.400
But, ah, what luck do we have here?

04:57.400 --> 05:02.220
One's consciousness, the world of dreams itself is my domain!

05:02.220 --> 05:06.240
It must be a present from heaven to have you here by chance.

05:06.240 --> 05:09.450
There is nothing to be worried about ladies and gentlemen.

05:09.810 --> 05:11.610
Just what I expected of you, Nightmare.

05:11.610 --> 05:16.650
It must be a present from heaven to have you here by chances.

05:16.650 --> 05:17.640
Hey...

05:18.790 --> 05:24.460
And thanks to that chance, the dream weaver that is me will surely save this girl!

05:24.460 --> 05:28.130
Hey you two! You already knew this would happen from the very beginning, huh?!

05:28.130 --> 05:29.740
What are you talking about?

05:29.740 --> 05:31.300
Dream?

05:33.810 --> 05:40.150
Currently, her self-consciousness is being held by the Jewel Of Temperance inside her very own dream.

05:41.030 --> 05:44.660
If we leave her like this, she will continue to sleep for all eternity.

05:44.660 --> 05:46.190
How can we wake her up?

05:46.190 --> 05:51.200
By entering directly into her dream and waking her of course.

05:51.540 --> 05:55.490
Now then, let Nightmare's dream begin...

05:55.490 --> 05:59.760
Dream... Dream!

06:03.340 --> 06:06.840
Please, forgive me, Elis-san.

06:07.530 --> 06:11.460
This is a trial in order to truly acquire the Jewel of Temperance.

06:12.060 --> 06:16.730
I believe that with the bond you all share right now, you will be able to overcome it.

06:18.820 --> 06:23.440
My oh my, Elis-chan was easily taken over by the Jewel of Temperance.

06:23.440 --> 06:28.720
There is a strong foundation in the heart of Shiho Elis.

06:28.720 --> 06:34.750
If we manipulate that, we could seal the Jewel inside her dream.

06:35.280 --> 06:39.020
Phelsmoor, its your turn.

06:40.420 --> 06:44.590
You should stay and play in your dream forever, Elis-chan.

06:50.100 --> 06:52.140
How far are we going to fall?!

06:52.140 --> 06:55.310
This is the border of Shiho Elis's self-conscioussness.

06:55.310 --> 06:59.560
We'll breakthrough her surface-consciousness soon and after that we'll be in her subconscious realm!

06:59.560 --> 07:01.480
When is 'soon'?!

07:03.030 --> 07:05.110
Even I don't know that!

07:05.110 --> 07:06.370
Don't be silly!

07:06.370 --> 07:10.510
Dream... Dream!

07:13.020 --> 07:14.070
Where is this place?

07:14.070 --> 07:16.150
Looks like we made it.

07:16.150 --> 07:18.290
Into Shiho Elis's dream world.

07:19.740 --> 07:21.000
A library?

07:21.000 --> 07:23.750
A dream reflects a person's desire.

07:23.750 --> 07:29.010
Most of them such as true love or important memories are reflected as they desire.

07:29.010 --> 07:31.880
Elis-chan really did like books, didn't she?

07:32.770 --> 07:34.420
Daddy Long Legs...?

07:34.420 --> 07:35.490
Same here.

07:35.490 --> 07:36.590
And here as well.

07:37.390 --> 07:41.380
Every book in here is the same as the one she had with her!

07:41.380 --> 07:44.480
Yes, because I love Daddy Long Legs!

07:49.000 --> 07:52.530
You know, I've always looked up to Daddy Long Legs.

07:52.530 --> 07:55.870
And then he really appeared to me, the real Daddy Long Legs!

07:56.930 --> 07:59.680
Elis-chan, why are you in the form of a child?

07:59.680 --> 08:03.750
The master of a dream can change themselves into any form they desire.

08:03.750 --> 08:05.250
That form...

08:05.250 --> 08:08.800
It must be because she had some kind of grudge towards her days as a child...

08:09.320 --> 08:11.680
So? What are we supposed to do?

08:11.680 --> 08:15.120
We need to take her, and bring her back to reality.

08:15.120 --> 08:17.140
That way she should awake.

08:17.140 --> 08:18.010
Okay.

08:21.320 --> 08:24.330
Elis, let's go back together.

08:24.330 --> 08:25.500
Go back?

08:25.500 --> 08:27.760
This is not reality, you know.

08:27.760 --> 08:31.440
You are trapped inside your dream world because of the effect of the Jewel of Tempera-

08:31.440 --> 08:33.000
It's Oji-sama!

08:33.000 --> 08:33.950
Oji-sama!

08:33.950 --> 08:34.970
Hey!

08:34.970 --> 08:36.540
Wait, Elis-chan!

08:36.540 --> 08:37.490
Wait!

08:39.280 --> 08:40.280
Dream!

08:46.000 --> 08:47.210
What the hell is this?

08:47.210 --> 08:48.740
Cream puffs?

08:48.740 --> 08:50.760
You mustn't Hiiragi Renji-kun!

08:50.760 --> 08:53.130
You mustn't barge in without thinking inside a dream wo-

08:53.130 --> 08:55.380
DREAM!!!

08:55.380 --> 08:58.010
What the hell is he doing?

08:58.010 --> 08:59.000
A foam?

08:59.000 --> 09:01.420
This marshmallow is like a trampoline!

09:02.240 --> 09:03.990
Hey, quit playing around!

09:05.980 --> 09:08.400
Wow, a cloud made of cotton candy!

09:08.400 --> 09:11.440
Hiiragi, look at it, it's so soft!

09:14.030 --> 09:16.490
WOW!!

09:19.180 --> 09:20.120
Delicious.

09:21.800 --> 09:23.870
You guys...

09:23.870 --> 09:28.090
I've prepared a lot of sweets, let's all be friends and eat them together!

09:31.880 --> 09:34.710
More importantly Elis, we need to hurry up and go back!

09:35.910 --> 09:36.930
Oji-sama?

09:38.020 --> 09:41.020
I'm sorry, but my Oji-sama is calling for me.

09:41.020 --> 09:42.310
Please have some of these.

09:42.310 --> 09:43.720
Wait, Elis!

09:48.000 --> 09:49.190
Where's this place?!

09:53.390 --> 09:54.570
Dream...

09:54.570 --> 09:56.280
Everyone, this way!

09:57.000 --> 09:59.530
It's okay to trust him, right?

09:59.810 --> 10:01.250
Dream...

10:02.740 --> 10:05.860
Ah, the road splits into two...

10:05.860 --> 10:08.000
Which way should we go, old man?

10:09.850 --> 10:11.190
I don't know.

10:11.190 --> 10:12.460
You guys!

10:13.080 --> 10:15.490
Let's head up for the time being, shall we?

10:17.800 --> 10:21.600
Geez, you all haven't changed at all have you?

10:21.600 --> 10:24.390
You're, that kid from the moon!

10:24.390 --> 10:26.260
You said your name was Kirihito-kun, right?

10:26.260 --> 10:29.120
Is it really okay to be hesitating in a place like this?

10:29.120 --> 10:31.670
Why are you even here?!

10:31.670 --> 10:33.900
Are you also here to help Elis?

10:36.300 --> 10:38.440
A dream is just a dream.

10:38.440 --> 10:42.950
No matter how fun and comfortable this place is, eventually one will wake up.

10:42.950 --> 10:43.950
Huh?!

10:43.950 --> 10:46.130
That's common sense!

10:46.130 --> 10:47.880
What's with that haughty attitude!

11:08.010 --> 11:09.750
What is this place?

11:10.790 --> 11:11.770
It's Elis.

11:11.770 --> 11:15.110
Put some tomato on top of it.

11:15.110 --> 11:18.770
Here you go, tomato and onion tart.

11:18.770 --> 11:22.320
A bear who dislikes vegetables needs to eat them.

11:22.790 --> 11:28.830
Elis-chan did say that she used to look after others by herself.

11:28.830 --> 11:31.080
Then is this Elis's memory?

11:31.080 --> 11:36.710
No, this must be a representative scene of a mental image created by her memory.

11:36.710 --> 11:40.260
I won't be lonely if I have everyone with me.

11:40.260 --> 11:46.700
Even if mom and dad aren't here, I don't feel... lonely...

11:48.010 --> 11:50.180
There's no way I'd be lonely...

12:06.200 --> 12:08.240
Elis, let's go back now.

12:09.750 --> 12:13.330
It's not like you to be crying here in a place like this.

12:13.330 --> 12:16.580
You're always the positive one no matter what the situation is, right?

12:17.680 --> 12:19.550
That's different from what Oji-sama said.

12:20.610 --> 12:24.650
Oji-sama said that I can stay here and play forever.

12:24.650 --> 12:30.240
He said he doesn't care who I am, as long as I stay here.

12:30.240 --> 12:31.180
Elis...

12:31.600 --> 12:34.160
Oji-sama is never wrong.

12:34.160 --> 12:37.020
Because Oji-sama is Oji-sama!

12:37.020 --> 12:38.110
Elis!

12:46.780 --> 12:49.330
14th March!

12:50.020 --> 12:52.830
Tada! Today is my birthday!

12:57.230 --> 12:59.560
Happy Birthday, Elis.

13:03.370 --> 13:06.000
It's the day we promised, Elis.

13:06.510 --> 13:07.860
Oji-sama!

13:08.790 --> 13:12.420
Stay with me forever, Elis.

13:12.420 --> 13:16.100
Let's live here together happily just like this.

13:16.100 --> 13:19.000
There's nothing scary or sad here at all.

13:19.000 --> 13:21.550
I'll take care of everything.

13:21.550 --> 13:22.610
Oji-sama!

13:23.010 --> 13:25.490
I am your only friend.

13:25.490 --> 13:27.400
You don't have to worry about anything.

13:27.400 --> 13:30.760
I will always be by your side protecting you.

13:31.520 --> 13:38.240
Elis, I don't know who that Oji-sama is, but don't listen to him!

13:38.240 --> 13:40.520
Open your eyes, Elis-chan!

13:40.520 --> 13:41.560
Elis.

13:42.760 --> 13:46.000
Elis, who do you believe, me or them?

13:46.000 --> 13:46.880
You!

13:47.320 --> 13:48.950
You answered instantly?! Hey!

13:48.950 --> 13:51.390
To Elis-chan, her Oji-sama is absolute.

13:52.850 --> 13:54.640
You there, who are you?

13:56.000 --> 13:59.870
You are not part of the composition of Shiho Elis's dream.

13:59.870 --> 14:03.070
What are you planning to do by diving into this place?

14:03.070 --> 14:08.070
This place is noisy, let's go somewhere peaceful.

14:08.070 --> 14:09.570
Okay, Oji-sama!

14:09.570 --> 14:10.370
Elis!

14:10.900 --> 14:14.000
Oji-sama, let's have a continuation of my birthday party, okay?

14:14.000 --> 14:16.160
Yes, and let's have a big party.

14:16.160 --> 14:19.600
Wait Elis, today is not your birthday!

14:19.600 --> 14:25.410
That's right, this year is the first time you promised to meet with your Oji-sama on your birthday!

14:25.410 --> 14:27.740
And you haven't even seen his photo!

14:28.300 --> 14:29.790
I see.

14:29.790 --> 14:34.850
His form reflects the form Shiho Elis desires to be her Oji-sama.

14:35.830 --> 14:36.720
Oji-sama?

14:36.720 --> 14:41.940
Shiho Elis-kun, take a look at the face of your Oji-sama one more time.

14:47.820 --> 14:51.280
No! Let go of me!

14:59.080 --> 15:00.180
Where?

15:00.180 --> 15:02.290
Where is my real Oji-sama?

15:02.290 --> 15:03.130
Elis!

15:03.130 --> 15:05.240
Hiiragi Renji-kun, take this!

15:06.550 --> 15:08.900
Something Anzelotte asked me to give you.

15:08.900 --> 15:10.720
Use it properly.

15:11.170 --> 15:12.430
Thank you!

15:15.600 --> 15:16.970
I won't let you go.

15:18.560 --> 15:24.310
Tresspasser of dreams, I'll show you the true meaning of a nightmare.

15:29.750 --> 15:32.780
Oji-sama, where is my real Oji-sama?

15:32.780 --> 15:35.770
I'll end up being alone again...

15:35.770 --> 15:36.450
Elis!

15:39.530 --> 15:42.180
Elis, Elis!

15:42.180 --> 15:44.480
I can't get in even if I want to like this.

15:44.480 --> 15:46.710
No, wait, can it be...

15:47.330 --> 15:48.920
Shrinking Tea.

15:48.920 --> 15:53.090
Level, height, ability and intelligence, it's interesting to see which will one will shrink.

15:53.090 --> 15:54.470
Hey!

15:55.290 --> 15:57.180
There's no other way I guess.

16:14.440 --> 16:17.640
Damn that Anzelotte!

16:17.640 --> 16:20.560
Elis, let's go back okay?

16:22.030 --> 16:24.240
This is all just a bad dream.

16:24.240 --> 16:27.960
Your real Oji-sama exists in the real world.

16:28.380 --> 16:30.250
You even have us!

16:31.370 --> 16:34.000
No one is going to disappear anymore?

16:34.510 --> 16:36.890
Leaving me all alone again?

16:37.440 --> 16:40.170
No one is going to pick on me?

16:40.880 --> 16:44.080
Yeah, no one is going to disappear.

16:44.080 --> 16:48.480
And if anyone picks on you, I'll protect you!

16:48.480 --> 16:51.320
Really? Will you promise me?

16:51.320 --> 16:54.120
Yes, I promise.

17:05.620 --> 17:06.330
He's fast!

17:09.790 --> 17:10.590
Dream!

17:19.760 --> 17:21.350
Sorry to keep you all waiting!

17:22.570 --> 17:25.000
Hiiragi? It's you right?!

17:25.000 --> 17:27.200
What happened to you? Why do you look like that?!

17:27.200 --> 17:30.310
It's not my fault! Blame it on Anzelotte's tea!

17:30.730 --> 17:33.010
You even dropped in age, huh?

17:33.010 --> 17:35.310
Just what I expect from the 'fallen man'.

17:35.310 --> 17:37.740
Stop calling me that!

17:38.840 --> 17:42.750
Elis, these people are deceiving you.

17:42.750 --> 17:44.080
Come here.

17:44.650 --> 17:46.660
You are not my Oji-sama!

17:53.340 --> 17:55.470
You've shown you're true self, huh, Emulator!

17:55.920 --> 17:58.360
I am the witch Phelsmoor.

17:58.360 --> 18:01.730
The one who lurks and corrodes dreams.

18:01.730 --> 18:08.640
Foolish humans, you wouldn't have to suffer had you obediently embraced my dream.

18:10.150 --> 18:12.030
Magic Shell!

18:20.110 --> 18:22.030
Damn it! The sword is too heavy!

18:24.760 --> 18:25.910
Hiiragi.

18:28.310 --> 18:28.920
YOU!

18:29.600 --> 18:30.790
Don't get in my way!

18:34.110 --> 18:35.970
How conceited!

18:38.210 --> 18:39.140
Elis!

18:39.840 --> 18:43.010
I... want to protect everyone!

18:49.180 --> 18:51.650
What's this? Elis?

19:01.250 --> 19:05.030
My light... return to me!

19:13.700 --> 19:16.090
Eyes of All!

19:17.630 --> 19:18.760
You damn brat!

19:28.680 --> 19:31.320
No! My magic!

19:40.090 --> 19:41.280
Unlock Magical Aura!

19:42.220 --> 19:43.530
You brat!

19:46.330 --> 19:47.080
What?!

19:55.150 --> 19:58.800
Bastard, don't think it will end like this!

20:08.580 --> 20:10.170
You did it, Hiiragi!

20:10.170 --> 20:12.320
Just what I expect from you, Hiiragi Renji-kun.

20:12.320 --> 20:14.190
Here, take this as congratulations on a job well done.

20:16.490 --> 20:18.020
Growing Tea.

20:18.020 --> 20:20.020
Hand it to me sooner!

20:21.280 --> 20:23.530
I totally forgot about it, Dream.

20:29.160 --> 20:32.080
Alright! Hiiragi Renji is back!

20:37.740 --> 20:39.670
The door to reality, huh.

20:39.670 --> 20:43.270
Yes, and thank you everyone.

20:43.270 --> 20:45.750
Let's meet back in the real world.

21:05.330 --> 21:08.900
Why am I sleeping?

21:08.900 --> 21:10.330
What did I do before this?

21:10.330 --> 21:13.600
I see, so she doesn't remember anything.

21:13.600 --> 21:14.250
Huh?

21:14.250 --> 21:16.480
You were so cute though.

21:16.480 --> 21:18.450
You were so sweet and fretful.

21:18.450 --> 21:19.700
Huh, eh?!

21:19.700 --> 21:20.540
Forget about it.

21:20.540 --> 21:21.530
EH!!?

21:21.530 --> 21:23.500
What in the world happened?!

21:23.500 --> 21:25.510
Tell me already!

21:27.250 --> 21:28.640
Geez!

21:32.500 --> 21:38.310
Yes, the fifth jewel is finally in Shiho Elis's hand.

21:38.310 --> 21:41.690
With this, there are only two jewels left.

21:41.690 --> 21:43.510
Justice and Hope.

21:44.010 --> 21:48.010
I strongly believe that they will be able to get their hands on it.

21:51.330 --> 21:56.520
Yes, as you say, our great god, Lord Geizer.

22:23.330 --> 22:26.270
I'm not going to let it end like this.

22:26.270 --> 22:30.570
I'll lurk in this girl's dreams and regain my power once more.

22:58.930 --> 23:02.560
Why?! Why is that thing in here?!

23:03.010 --> 23:03.940
You saw it, huh.

23:07.000 --> 23:08.990
You saw it, didn't you.

23:14.210 --> 23:18.520
NOOOO!!!

24:50.340 --> 24:56.260
Oji-sama, the mission is hard, but I didn't neglect my studies.

24:56.260 --> 24:58.760
This means, next week is skating class.

24:58.760 --> 25:02.450
This is my first time skating, but I'll skate as best as I can.

25:02.450 --> 25:06.080
I can't rely on Hiiragi-senpai all the time, right?

25:06.080 --> 25:11.610
Next in Night Wizard THE ANIMATION, Small Bonds, Elis's Present.

25:11.610 --> 25:14.770
Even a skating class is a good class!
